# The architecture we're building

After 13 is complete:

```text
                         GALAXY
                            │
       ┌────────────────────┼────────────────────┐
       │                    │                    │
       ↓                    ↓                    ↓
     System              Process              Network
                            │                    │
                            │                    ├── Interface
                            │                    ├── Port
                            │                    └── Connection
                            │
                    Process Identity
                            │
                    Process Lifecycle
                            │
                    Process Relationships
                            │
             ┌──────────────┴──────────────┐
             ↓                             ↓
         Service                       Network
             │                             │
             │ manages                     │
             ↓                             │
         Process ─────── listens_on ──────┘
             │
             │ has_connection
             ↓
      Network Connection
```

And eventually:

```text
Service
   │
   └── Process
         │
         ├── CPU
         ├── Memory
         ├── Lifecycle
         ├── Listening Port
         └── Network Connection
```

That is the **machine understanding** layer we wanted.

